<codeline><highlight class="normal">#<sp/>GPIO<sp/>{#DRIVERS_GPIO_PAGE}</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">[TOC]</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">The<sp/>GPIO<sp/>module<sp/>provides<sp/>an<sp/>API<sp/>to<sp/>configure,<sp/>read<sp/>from,<sp/>and<sp/>write<sp/>to<sp/>the<sp/>GPIO<sp/>pins.<sp/>Functions<sp/>fall<sp/>into<sp/>the<sp/>two<sp/>categories,<sp/>control<sp/>and<sp/>data.<sp/>Control<sp/>functions<sp/>configure<sp/>properties<sp/>pin<sp/>muxing,<sp/>and<sp/>qualification.<sp/>Data<sp/>functions<sp/>allow<sp/>you<sp/>to<sp/>read<sp/>the<sp/>value<sp/>on<sp/>a<sp/>pin<sp/>or<sp/>write<sp/>a<sp/>value<sp/>to<sp/>it.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">Most<sp/>functions<sp/>will<sp/>configure<sp/>a<sp/>single<sp/>pin<sp/>at<sp/>a<sp/>time.<sp/>The<sp/>pin<sp/>to<sp/>be<sp/>configured<sp/>will<sp/>be<sp/>specified<sp/>using<sp/>its<sp/>GPIO<sp/>number.<sp/>Refer<sp/>to<sp/>the<sp/>device’s<sp/>datasheet<sp/>to<sp/>learn<sp/>what<sp/>numbers<sp/>are<sp/>valid<sp/>for<sp/>that<sp/>part<sp/>number.<sp/>Also<sp/>note<sp/>that<sp/>even<sp/>if<sp/>a<sp/>GPIO<sp/>number<sp/>is<sp/>valid<sp/>for<sp/>a<sp/>part<sp/>number,<sp/>it<sp/>may<sp/>not<sp/>be<sp/>valid<sp/>for<sp/>all<sp/>possible<sp/>features.<sp/>For<sp/>instance,<sp/>GPIO_setAnalogMode()<sp/>is<sp/>only<sp/>usable<sp/>for<sp/>a<sp/>fraction<sp/>of<sp/>the<sp/>GPIO<sp/>numbers.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">For<sp/>information<sp/>and<sp/>functions<sp/>to<sp/>configure<sp/>a<sp/>pin<sp/>for<sp/>low-power<sp/>mode<sp/>wake-up,<sp/>see<sp/>the<sp/>SysCtl<sp/>module.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">##<sp/>Example<sp/>Usage</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
